Title:  A foolish consistency

Seq:    12.6.51.1.1

Level:  6 - Subdetail

Class:  quote

Attribution: [[Emerson, Ralph Waldo|Ralph Waldo Emerson]], 1841, from the essay "[[Essential Writings of Ralph Waldo Emerson]]"

